And there's a funny thing, like even though I said they were a bit callous about poor Mark who died, there's a funny kind of thematic overlap of like, well, that's how it ends for everybody.
还有件有趣的事，虽然我说他们对可怜的Mark的死有点冷漠，但这里有一种有趣的、关于“这就是每个人的结局”的主题重叠。

00:38:17.309 --> 00:38:20.590
So eventually we all die at some point.
所以最终我们所有人都会死。

