关于结局或结果，到底有什么了不起的呢？

00:38:25.389 --> 00:38:27.630
Who cares who won that game?
谁在乎那场比赛谁赢了？

00:38:27.630 --> 00:38:28.989
Who cares what the end is?
谁在乎结局是什么？

00:38:28.989 --> 00:38:32.630
The end is, you know, the ultimate end is we all die.
结局就是，你知道，最终的结局是我们都会死。

00:38:34.269 --> 00:38:41.510
Well, that's also, but we better enjoy watching the fucking game together as the most important part.
嗯，确实如此，但我们最好还是享受一起看那场该死的比赛，这才是最重要的部分。

00:38:41.510 --> 00:38:43.909
The end result is not the most important thing.
最终结果并不是最重要的。

00:38:43.909 --> 00:38:50.429
Well Craig, that's what our kind of response is when people say like, this could have been 15 minutes.
嗯，Craig，当人们说“这集本来可以缩短到15分钟”时，我们的回应就是这样。

00:38:50.429 --> 00:38:52.269
It's like, well, that's not an interesting show.
就像是，嗯，那样的节目就没意思了。

00:38:52.269 --> 00:38:54.949
You know, like the entire show was always about the journey.
你知道，整部剧一直以来都是关于过程的。

00:38:54.949 --> 00:39:03.510
It was always about, and when people would get upset, you know, when the show was on the air, there were certain how I made your mother obsessives that were obsessed with who the mother was.
一直都是这样，当人们感到沮丧时，你知道，当剧集还在播出时，有一些《老爸老妈浪漫史》的死忠粉，他们沉迷于“老妈”到底是谁。

00:39:03.510 --> 00:39:09.670
Like that was the big mystery to crack as if this was like a true crime podcast or something.
好像这是什么需要破解的重大谜案，就像在听真实犯罪播客一样。

00:39:09.670 --> 00:39:11.429
But that was never the thing.
但那从来都不是重点。

00:39:11.429 --> 00:39:13.630
I mean, it was a fun thing to hang it on.
我的意思是，把它作为一个噱头很有趣。

00:39:13.630 --> 00:39:18.170
and it probably helped you guys sell the show to have a kind of hook, but that was never the thing.
而且这可能确实帮助你们卖掉了这部剧，因为它有一个钩子，但那从来都不是重点。

00:39:18.170 --> 00:39:23.489
The thing was always, how do we create a context where people can hang out and love each other and laugh?
重点始终是，我们如何创造一个环境，让人们可以聚在一起、相爱并欢笑。

00:39:23.489 --> 00:39:26.769
And I think maybe Andrew was hinting at that in his thoughtful answer too.
我想Andrew在他那深思熟虑的回答中可能也暗示了这一点。

00:39:26.769 --> 00:39:31.849
Like there's something, this is in miniature the entire series in some way.
就像在某种程度上，这集是整个系列的缩影。

00:39:31.849 --> 00:39:34.250
Yeah, there's gonna be a result, there's gonna be a score.
是的，会有结果，会有比分。

00:39:34.250 --> 00:39:40.969
There will be a thing ascertained and the clock will stop and it'll be a result and they don't remember what the fucking result is.
事情总会水落石出，时钟会停止，会有个结果，但他们根本不记得那个该死的结果是什么。

00:39:40.969 --> 00:39:43.949
The whole episode is about that and you never hear what it is.
整集都在讲这个，但你永远不知道那到底是什么。

00:39:43.949 --> 00:39:47.829
And I think that's a really great way to say it's the journey that matters.
我觉得这是一种很好的表达方式，说明过程才是最重要的。

00:39:47.829 --> 00:39:49.309
And it's being together that matters.
在一起才是最重要的。

00:39:49.309 --> 00:39:50.150
Yeah.
没错。

00:39:50.150 --> 00:39:59.630
Well, it wasn't also there was a little bit of a wink to the series, because in the narrate at the very end, he says like, even though you know how it's gonna end, that's not the point.
嗯，这其实也算是对剧集本身的一点致敬，因为在最后旁白里，他说即使你知道结局会怎样，那也不是重点。

00:39:59.630 --> 00:40:00.630
