So you were you were always good at that for all of us including me and Carter when we were the youngins, not knowing what we're doing.
所以你，你总是对我们所有人，包括我和卡特，当我们是年轻人，不知道自己在做什么时，都很擅长这一点。

00:48:15.269 --> 00:48:26.849
Well, I think there was, what I was trying to say earlier was, you always reminded me that this was a great gig, like, like there's so many other harder ways to make a living than what we were doing.
嗯，我想有，我刚才想说的是，你总是提醒我这是一份很棒的工作，就像，就像有那么多比我们正在做的更难的谋生方式。

00:48:26.849 --> 00:48:30.369
And you were like a walking reminder of that.
而你就像一个行走的提醒。

00:48:30.369 --> 00:48:31.369
So thank you.
所以谢谢你。

00:48:31.369 --> 00:48:32.369
You're welcome.
不客气。

00:48:32.369 --> 00:48:33.369
You're welcome.
不客气。

