And we knew we did, we knew we had a good one when we would pitch a bit in the room and Rob would say, yes, that's the green birdie and yes, give us one, Rob, we've, we've, we have to earn it.
我们知道我们做到了，当我们提出一个点子，罗伯说“没错，这就是那个‘绿鸟’（green birdie），没错，再给我们来一个”，罗伯，我们必须得赢得它。

00:48:43.369 --> 00:48:44.244
at the urn.
在骨灰瓮旁。

00:48:44.244 --> 00:48:46.629
You directed the best episode.
你执导了最棒的一集。

00:48:46.629 --> 00:48:48.616
I'm not a wind up monkey.
我可不是什么上发条的猴子。

