Dear Josh Craig and Alec, I hope this message finds you well.
亲爱的乔什、克雷格和亚历克，希望你们一切都好。

00:49:58.610 --> 00:50:04.889
My name is Alex, writing from far away the Balkan Peninsula in Serbia.
我叫亚历克斯，从遥远的巴尔干半岛塞尔维亚写信给你们。

00:50:04.889 --> 00:50:10.449
Here most people I know watched him in high school back when seasons four and five were airing.
在这里，我认识的大多数人都是在高中时看这部剧的，那时第四季和第五季正在播出。

00:50:10.449 --> 00:50:12.110
I somehow missed that wave.
我不知怎么错过了那波热潮。

00:50:12.110 --> 00:50:20.280
I didn't begin watching the show until I was at university around 2013 to 2014, but the moment I did, I was completely hooked.
直到2013到2014年上大学时我才开始看这部剧，但从那一刻起，我就彻底迷上了。

00:50:20.280 --> 00:50:24.360
Since then, for the past 12 years, the show has been a quiet companion in my life.
从那时起的过去12年里，这部剧一直是我生活中安静的伴侣。

00:50:24.360 --> 00:50:31.780
I've re-watched it many times, especially in the early days of COVID when I was 27, the same age as the characters in those early seasons.
我重温过很多次，尤其是在新冠疫情初期，当时我27岁，和剧中前几季角色的年龄一样。

00:50:31.780 --> 00:50:37.579
Now, in my early 30s, re-watching the show again feels different yet equally powerful.
现在我30出头，再次重温这部剧感觉不同，但同样充满力量。

00:50:37.579 --> 00:50:40.260
When I was younger, it was the love story that struck me.
年轻时，打动我的是爱情故事。

00:50:40.260 --> 00:50:49.099
And now it's the whole worldview of the show, the friendships, the searching, the heartbreak, the growing up, the strange mix of melancholy and joy that adulthood brings.
而现在，是整部剧的世界观、友谊、探索、心碎、成长，以及成年生活带来的那种忧郁与快乐的奇妙混合。

00:50:49.099 --> 00:50:52.860
There's an honesty in it that only grows with age.
其中有一种随着年龄增长而愈发深刻的诚实。

00:50:52.860 --> 00:50:58.219
And now with some distance, I also realize how much I miss the world the show portrays.
现在回过头来看，我也意识到我有多么怀念这部剧所描绘的世界。

00:50:58.219 --> 00:51:10.159
A few days ago, I re-watched the episode where the gang gets smartphones for the first time, and from today's perspective, it already feels like a classic, a little time capsule in a world that is slipping away.
几天前，我重温了那集大家第一次用上智能手机的剧集，从今天的角度来看，它已经感觉像是一部经典，是一个正在消逝的世界里的小小时间胶囊。

00:51:10.159 --> 00:51:15.699
Originally I discovered Josh's music, unfortunately only last year, it's never too late.
最初我发现乔什的音乐，遗憾的是直到去年才发现，不过永远都不晚。

00:51:15.699 --> 00:51:20.969
As someone who has been making music for a large part of my life, that immediately struck a chord in me.
作为一个大半辈子都在创作音乐的人，这立刻引起了我的共鸣。

00:51:20.969 --> 00:51:24.230
For the first time, I thought maybe I should also try to sing.
我第一次想，也许我也应该尝试唱歌。

00:51:24.230 --> 00:51:32.789
And so as a small homage to the show, I wrote two songs inspired by himium, something completely and utterly different from the music that I usually write and record.
所以作为对这部剧的一点致敬，我写了两首受《老爸老妈浪漫史》启发的歌，这和我平时创作和录制的音乐完全不同。

00:51:32.789 --> 00:51:37.989
Thank you for creating something so heartfelt, funny, human, and enduring.
感谢你们创造了如此真诚、有趣、人性化且经久不衰的作品。

00:51:37.989 --> 00:51:42.998
has influenced more of my life than I ever expected a television show could.
它对我的生活产生的影响超出了我对一部电视剧的预期。

